{"pageId":"f181e606-fc63-4257-b0e5-0e0f8acd937e","pageCanonId":"a4aa0cf5-4017-4dea-ae51-edb8e950bd2c","title":"Choosing a scheme","slug":"choosing-a-scheme","headerTitle":"Choosing a scheme","description":"Static color schemes emphasize brand and uniformity, while dynamic schemes emphasize content or user settings to make products feel more personal","headerAlignment":"LEFT","isDescriptionVisible":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T04:58:33.154Z","headerImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmroe2yc6-Color.png?alt=media","sections":[{"pageSectionId":"43345f53-a3c5-45b3-ba29-7159f0f3ba63","pageSectionCanonId":"4bbd1052-f90e-48e4-8325-f57f86e16c31","name":"Tab 1","position":0,"pageId":"cf0cf18d-6df1-4dca-a275-f3159d498c26","pageCanonId":"a4aa0cf5-4017-4dea-ae51-edb8e950bd2c","isVisible":true,"contentBlocks":[{"pageContentBlockId":"0ce1f832-ae3f-435b-bbe1-016a9f757e2b","pageContentBlockCanonId":"168b188a-4489-4d5f-bf66-7f03fec9661c","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"43345f53-a3c5-45b3-ba29-7159f0f3ba63","pageSectionCanonId":"4bbd1052-f90e-48e4-8325-f57f86e16c31","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"e70338ca-b38b-4de8-ac74-0ed7ffb69757","pageContentChunkCanonId":"07bc9730-049d-442b-9d4c-f2c6b6950331","htmlValue":"<p>A <strong>color scheme</strong> describes all of a product's colors, color roles, and color relationships across light and dark themes.</p><p>There are two kinds of color schemes in Material:</p><ol><li><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Static colors are UI colors that don't change based on the user's wallpaper or in-app content. Once assigned to their respective color roles and UI elements, the colors remain constant.\" link-label=\"Jump to static color\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/choosing-a-scheme/tab-1#3e05eecf-d91d-446f-b478-47cd144cce17\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Static</app-froala-tooltip-element></li><li><app-froala-tooltip-element description=\"Dynamic color takes a single color from a user's wallpaper or in-app content and creates an accessible color scheme assigned to elements in the UI.\" link-label=\"Jump to dynamic color\" link-url=\"/m3/pages/choosing-a-scheme/tab-1#00d5b65d-dd10-42c5-baaf-cd129cc2c1b5\" should-open-link-in-new-tab=\"true\">Dynamic</app-froala-tooltip-element></li></ol>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2025-01-22T03:02:17.342Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"f102531f-cec2-412d-83a6-f105c71bd706","pageContentBlockCanonId":"e9f3faf4-6e01-48bb-9032-070d049e4f9e","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"43345f53-a3c5-45b3-ba29-7159f0f3ba63","pageSectionCanonId":"4bbd1052-f90e-48e4-8325-f57f86e16c31","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"e6604796-3879-4233-ad54-d142f7b29831","pageContentChunkCanonId":"c052b0d4-28bc-4469-923b-858ead874a0f","htmlValue":"","footer":"<p>Discover when and how to use different color schemes, including static baseline, dynamic user-generated, and dynamic content-based color schemes</p>","imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"Types of color schemes in Material Design 3.","videoUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgm3sandbox%2Fimages%2Flinbzkgu-MAT020.05-v2%20Internal.mp4?alt=media","videoHeight":1080,"videoWidth":1920,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"